-- Experiment 171 -- SIAM 100-Digit Challenge, Problem 6 (FriCAS column).
-- The statement is a root solve G(eps) = 2 around a 2-D integral.  FriCAS has
-- no numeric root finder for a black-box function (solve(p, eps) needs a
-- polynomial) and no 2-D quadrature, so both rows SKIP.  See biased_flea.m.
)read ../siam100_common.input )quiet
vskip("c6.machine", "FindRoot")
vskip("c6.wp50", "FindRoot")
)quit
